<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθώπευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unflattered, without
				flattery</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐμῆς γλώσσης</span>
			<i>from</i> my tongue, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				459
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not open to flattery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1399
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.144
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not flattering</i>, Teles<i><span class="en">
				p.44.8H.
			</span></i>; hence, <i>rough, rude</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.168
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Sil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συρίγματα</span>, of the
					<i><span class="en">Python,
					<u>Pae.Delph.</u>20</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδροσίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1796.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without flattery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				15.193d
			</span></i>.</div>
